---
/* SPEAKERS — Leonardo Artist Stories card row.

  RESOLVED 13 Oct 2026: this was the highest-risk placeholder on the site, three
  invented names behind real stock photography. The client supplied the actual
  lineup and their own photographs, so both halves are now real.

  No roles. The client was explicit that the speakers do not have titles, only
  names, so nothing is invented to fill the slot. The per-discipline name
  colouring went with the roles: without a stated discipline, tinting a name
  music-teal or film-blue would be decoration asserting something we were never
  told. */
---
<section class="spk g-dark" id="speakers" data-fade>
  <h2 class="spk__head">
    <!-- The mark used to REPLACE the A ("SPE<mark>KERS"), which made the word
         unreadable. That was a misreading of the reference in SECTIONS.md:
         Leonardo puts its mark BETWEEN words (ARTIST * STORIES) as a separator,
         never inside one. The word is whole again and the mark trails it as a
         seal, so P7 still has a real job without costing legibility. -->
    SPEAKERS<span class="spk__mark" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="46" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="8"/>
        <path d="M50 50 H82" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="8" fill="none"/>
        <path d="M28 30 H72 M50 30 V72" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="8" fill="none"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
  </h2>
  <p class="spk__sub">Three voices for the day</p>

  <div class="spk__row" id="spkRow">
    <article class="spk__card">
      <div class="spk__img"><img src="/img/spk-asah.webp" width="720" height="720"
           alt="Asah Gold" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
      <div class="spk__bar"><p class="spk__name">Asah Gold</p></div>
    </article>
    <article class="spk__card">
      <div class="spk__img"><img src="/img/spk-dafe.webp" width="720" height="720"
           alt="Dafe Richard" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
      <div class="spk__bar"><p class="spk__name">Dafe Richard</p></div>
    </article>
    <article class="spk__card">
      <div class="spk__img"><img src="/img/spk-brave.webp" width="720" height="720"
           alt="Brave" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
      <div class="spk__bar"><p class="spk__name">Brave</p></div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
